coder › Implemented retry with exponential backoff on branch `work/retry-impl`.

What changed:
- `src/retry.ts`: `retry(fn, {attempts, baseMs, sleep})` validates `attempts < 1` with `RangeError` before calling `fn`; loops up to `attempts` times returning first success; between attempts awaits `sleep(baseMs * 2**(attempt-1))` (so baseMs, 2×, 4×…); after last failure throws `Error('gave up after N attempts: <last message>', {cause: lastError})`. `sleep` defaults to a real `setTimeout` wait. Non-`Error` last failures stringify into the message and still become `cause`.
- `src/retry.test.ts` (new): 6 tests using a recording `sleep` that pushes requested ms into an array — first-try success with no waits, success after 3 failures asserting waits `[10,20,40]`, give-up asserting message prefix/full text, `cause` identity, call count and waits `[5,10]`, single-attempt no-sleep case, `RangeError` on `attempts: 0` with `fn` never called, and default-sleep smoke test.

